  "changes": [
    "Local operator device show/set/reset controls use the existing communication profile and post-commit WAL.",
    "New preferences require the unique active paired-device grant. Explicit historical revision permits only inspect/reset and reclaims old epoch capacity.",
    "Only signed active Companion v1 conversation admission supplies the private UUID-plus-grant-revision scope. Reconnect retains the epoch; revocation/re-pair cannot transfer it.",
    "Shared primary and agent prompt preparation resolve explicit Session then Device then existing global/channel preferences.",
    "Incognito, disabled adaptation, stateless legacy requests, generic exports, GUI and checkpoint identity hydration do not mint device context.",
    "Existing input and stored-state validators reject nonlocal, passive, mismatched and globally cached device evidence.",
    "The existing CLI-reference workflow adds one bounded 29-case mode with exact identity, discovery, pass and source bindings, followed by actual CLI export."
  ],
